      "safety8otes": "No new hazards in this lesson. If learners handle any electrical components during the practical assessment demonstration, ensure hands are dry and all connections are insulated. Scissors or craft tools used in model-making should be handled carefully. Ensure adequate spacing at desks during the written assessment segment."
